<3 Array functionality test

<3 Declare an array of size 3
(o_o) numbers :=) [3]

<3 Assign values to array elements
numbers[0] :=) 10
numbers[1] :=) 20
numbers[2] :=) 30

<3 Use arrays in expressions
sum :=) numbers[0] :+) numbers[1]
:P(sum)

<3 Print individual elements
:P(numbers[2])

<3 Declare array with initialization
(o_o) values :=) [2] :=) [100, 200]
:P(values[0])
:P(values[1])